## Tools for this project

| Tool | Role |

| Node.js + npm | Runs and installs the project (install from nodejs.org beforehand) | BACKEND
| Vite + React | The app framework: fast dev server, component-based UI | FRONTEND
| Plain CSS (or Tailwind) | Styling. Plain CSS is simpler, and a dark theme is just a few variables | FRONTEND
| JSON files | Lesson content, so no database is needed | BACKEND
| localStorage | Saves XP, streak, hearts and progress in the browser | BACKEND
| Claude Code | Each of you uses your own to scaffold and debug | BACKEND
| GitHub + Vercel | The repo, plus free auto-deploy on every push to `main` | FRONTEND